    apply: "Write your personal covenant and share it with a trusted friend or leader. Join or form a study group to continue learning. Teach one lesson to someone else. Memorise Revelation 22:20. Share your plan with a trusted friend or family member this week and ask them to check in with you, then thank God for any progress.",
    activity: "Review the course by sharing one lesson and one commitment each. Read Revelation 22:12-21 and Titus 2:11-14 together. The teacher or pastor prays a prayer of commissioning for each learner. Close by praying together, Come, Lord Jesus.",
